ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["OSM supplies the curved 137 m hotel slab, 21 m podium and narrow mast reaching 174 m. The outline height includes the mast, not the hotel roof.","The inspected 2014 Commons close view shows the rounded slab end and regular narrow windows between pale vertical piers. A 4 m floor pitch and 4.2 m bay spacing are schematic facade inferences, not surveyed room positions.","The saved exterior predates later renovation; roof equipment, lettering and small aerial dishes are omitted. Window glazing uses the shared light-blue material."],"source":{"url":"/objects/bc80806411e8193cf269eff36be2b4851393e9dac2af1888e91ea5392c5889c7/source.blend.gz","bytes":187413,"sha256":"bc80806411e8193cf269eff36be2b4851393e9dac2af1888e91ea5392c5889c7"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/91e83a1d45e7f8c40c51c73d0bc0d49449e981dbcb807be22b8b5c5784de8428/spatial-source.json","bytes":12182,"sha256":"91e83a1d45e7f8c40c51c73d0bc0d49449e981dbcb807be22b8b5c5784de8428"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/b83356ff4a908a2bef858c5362f18a75c82a5c19d81c34e287221a08d0063d98/preview.webp","bytes":13360,"sha256":"b83356ff4a908a2bef858c5362f18a75c82a5c19d81c34e287221a08d0063d98"},"revision":"e0183906b562e847821390abaf28361406f22d19dbb657b3d03eff5adce01e5f","publicationRevision":"e79b087b2502d84c37005cdacfe9f82583182a25271aa412606c9f1396c13279","bounds":[2.2836699,48.8798289,2.2848115,48.8806038],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647","url":"/materials/f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647.json"},"metadata":"/assets/hyatt-regency-paris-etoile/e79b087b2502d84c37005cdacfe9f82583182a25271aa412606c